Pestilence is generally considered the most dangerous of the three. If he
makes you ill, you must cease fighting him, and consentrate on healing
yourself.

The same, in a way, goes for Famine, who'll make you hungry very quickly
if he gets any hits in. You must cease fighting to eat, which means he can
hit again without getting hit himself.

Death is generally considered easiest. The only complication with him is
that some of the common ways to fight Pestilence and Famine won't work on
him (wand of death, the analogous spell).

